<p>A student opened fire at a middle school in Kahramanmaras in southeastern Turkey on Wednesday, killing nine people — eight students and one teacher — and injuring 13 others, officials said. Several reports said the attacker was an eighth-grade student, described as 13 or 14 years old, who brought multiple firearms to school and later died during the incident. Authorities said the shooting happened in two classrooms and that six of the wounded were in critical condition. The attack came a day after another school shooting in Siverek, in Sanliurfa province, where an ex-student wounded 16 people before killing himself, making this Turkey’s second school shooting in two days. Officials said they believe the Kahramanmaras suspect may have used guns belonging to his father, a former police officer, and Anadolu reported that police detained the father as investigators worked to establish exactly how the weapons were obtained.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/5d6K_V24DdIQCY9aahFnCA39CXflcAjEt9X7851PP9Xm5XmVP0p-XJRncwKzO54B8m-JpYYRsZwj7dYCix4-eIYksMwnYUuMuhgV03aNUcmbL5f4OzObX7fN_Vl7OVSITvgK-z_g2J1Hzlc5Fjf2t6IMPpLm8hrEg1wiujgvR_AOtIL_OZpk-ZrFpTlHLylWnQpqqQ8qdlGRgZiOfDz_WYlQx8uMwgf3OCCZkaOVdsDrkSa5m23dqZSiALS_MjaMyKmcWfmSA3fyYt9TTA' alt='People wait in front of the school building after a deadly shooting, in the southeastern province of Kahramanmaras, Turkey, April 15, 2026.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Weapons carried: Governor Mukerrem Unluer said the student had five guns, and some reports added that he was carrying seven magazines.</li><li>Escape scenes: Verified footage and broadcast video showed students fleeing through the courtyard and jumping from school windows to escape the gunfire.</li><li>Casualty confusion: Early provincial updates put the toll at four dead and 20 wounded, but later statements from Interior Minister Mustafa Ciftci revised it to nine dead and 13 injured as authorities clarified the casualty count.</li><li>Concealment: The Hindu reported that the eighth-grader hid his father&#x27;s guns in a backpack before entering the school, a detail that sits at the center of questions about how the weapons got onto campus.</li></ul><blockquote>We regret to report nine deaths (…) and 13 wounded. Six of them are currently in intensive care, three of whom are in critical condition. - Interior Minister Mustafa Ciftci</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Governor Mukerrem Unluer: Unluer said it was still unclear whether the attacker&#x27;s death was a suicide or happened in the chaos after the shooting. (<a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1991984/nine-killed-13-wounded-after-school-shooting-in-turkiyes-second-school-shooting-in-2-days'>Dawn</a>)</li><li>Interior Minister Mustafa Ciftci: Ciftci said the shooting was a personal act carried out by one of the school&#x27;s own students, framing it as an attack from within rather than one carried out by an outsider. (<a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/middle-east/article/3350209/least-4-dead-turkeys-second-school-shooting-2-days'>SCMP</a>)</li><li>CHP provincial chair Unal Ates: Ates told Cumhuriyet that the attacker had mental issues and was known at school as a problematic child, offering a local political account of warning signs people said they had noticed before the shooting. (<a href='https://www.rt.com/news/638454-school-shooting-turkiye-kahramanmaras/'>RT</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.rt.com/news/638454-school-shooting-turkiye-kahramanmaras/'>Türkiye rocked by second school shooting in two days</a> - rt.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/middle-east/four-dead-after-turkeys-second-school-shooting-in-two-days'>13-year-old boy kills 9, wounds 13 in latest Turkey school shooting</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/1-dead-in-shooting-at-school-in-turkey-second-such-incident-in-24-hours-11361250#publisher=newsstand'>5 Guns, 7 Magazines: 13-Year-Old Kills 9 In Turkey School, Then Shoots Self</a> - ndtv.com</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/middle-east/article/3350209/least-4-dead-turkeys-second-school-shooting-2-days'>At least 9 dead in Turkey’s second school shooting in 2 days</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='http://www.euronews.com/video/2026/04/15/panicked-scenes-after-school-shooting-in-turkey-leaves-at-least-nine-dead'>Panicked scenes after school shooting in Turkey leaves at least nine dead</a> - euronews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.lemonde.fr/en/international/article/2026/04/15/shooting-in-turkish-school-leaves-at-least-nine-dead-and-13-injured_6752464_4.html'>Shooting in Turkish school leaves at least nine dead and 13 injured</a> - lemonde.fr</li><li><a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/news/turkey-school-shooting-kahramanmaras/'>Eighth grader kills 9, wounds 13 in Turkey school shooting</a> - cbsnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.allsides.com/news/2026-04-15-0700/world-least-4-dead-second-school-shooting-turkey-two-days'>At Least 4 Dead in Second School Shooting in Turkey in Two Days</a> - allsides.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theglobeandmail.com/world/article-turkey-school-shooting/'>At least nine killed, 13 wounded in Turkey’s second school shooting in two days</a> - theglobeandmail.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dw.com/en/turkey-school-shooting-leaves-9-dead/a-76791529'>Turkey: School shooting leaves 9 dead</a> - dw.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cn088n9e6e9o'>Nine killed in second Turkish school shooting in two days</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1991984/nine-killed-13-wounded-after-school-shooting-in-turkiyes-second-school-shooting-in-2-days'>Nine killed, 13 wounded after school shooting in Turkiye’s second school shooting in 2 days</a> - dawn.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/four-dead-after-turkiyes-second-school-shooting-in-two-days/article70865199.ece'>Four dead after Turkiye&#x27;s second school shooting 